%% Figure 4.23 – State Machine Diagram: crab_item.status (Crab in a box) · v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4
%% Same content as CrabShare_State_Machines.drawio, page "crab_item.status" (generated by gen-state.js, do not edit by hand).
%% «planned» = Register v1.4, not in code (class planned, grey dashed) · (not written by code) = CHECK value never written (class notwritten, orange dashed).
%% Labels are short (trigger [guard] / effect); the full label of each transition is in the %% line under it.
%% Design decisions of 05/11/2026 applied here were confirmed by the lead.
stateDiagram-v2
  state "DeliveredInKind (not written by code)" as DeliveredInKind
  state "Lost (not written by code)" as Lost
  [*] --> Growing : / stocking or restock · UC17
  %% / created by stocking (Owner) or restock (Owner or Staff): event Stocked · UC17
  Growing --> Growing : molted or relocated · UC17
  %% molted or relocated / event Molted or Relocated · UC17
  Growing --> Dead : mortality event [evidence photo] / box Available · UC17
  %% mortality event (Owner or Staff) [evidence photo of the box] / box Available, event Died, alert by policy · UC17
  Growing --> InStock : harvest record [harvest Open] / weight, grade · UC22
  %% harvest record (Owner or Staff) [harvest Open] / weight_g, grade, harvest_record, box Available · UC22 «planned» recorded per box, no printed tag
  InStock --> Packed : pack for an order (today in code) · UC29
  %% pack for an order (Operator) [grade matches the line] / order_line_id, event Packed (today in code) · UC29 «planned» replaced in v1.4 by Crab.OrderId: crabs of a box assigned on the delivery note, order QR code (no tag scan)
  Packed --> Sold : order delivered · UC29, UC30
  %% order delivered (Operator or Customer) / event Delivered · UC29, UC30 «planned» v1.4: when the balance is paid
  InStock --> Sold : «planned» invoiced sale or final order recorded · UC50, UC51
  %% «planned» invoiced sale or final order recorded (Operator) / sold with an Invoice · UC50, UC51
  Packed --> InStock : «planned» order Forfeited / back to stock · UC50
  %% «planned» order Forfeited (delivery refused or balance unpaid) / back to stock for an InvoicedSale (ForfeitResale) · UC50
  Packed --> Lost : «planned» died in transit / not charged · UC29
  %% «planned» died or spoiled in transit / transit loss, not charged (assumed use of Lost) · UC29
  InStock --> DeliveredInKind : settle in kind (not written by code)
  Dead --> [*]
  Sold --> [*]
  DeliveredInKind --> [*]
  Lost --> [*]
  note right of DeliveredInKind
    DeliveredInKind - CHECK value (not written by code)
  end note
  note right of Lost
    Lost - CHECK value (not written by code)
  end note
  note right of Growing
    «planned» on Growing → InStock - recorded per box, no printed tag
    «planned» survival rate counts every Dead crab of the funded boxes, restocked crabs included, a crab Lost in transit does not count (Figure 4.14).
  end note
  note right of InStock
    «planned» on InStock → Packed - replaced in v1.4 by Crab.OrderId - crabs of a box assigned on the delivery note, order QR code (no tag scan)
    «planned» InStock → Sold - invoiced sale or final order recorded (Operator) / sold with an Invoice
  end note
  note right of Packed
    «planned» on Packed → Sold - v1.4 - when the balance is paid
    «planned» Packed → InStock - order Forfeited (delivery refused or balance unpaid) / back to stock for an InvoicedSale (ForfeitResale)
    «planned» Packed → Lost - died or spoiled in transit / transit loss, not charged (assumed use of Lost)
  end note
  %% Created by stocking (Owner) or restock (Owner or Staff) only if: a restock replaces a Dead crab in the same box, before the restock cutoff, with an evidence photo (UC17).
  %% ck_crab_item_harvest_fields: Growing and Dead have no harvest; every other status needs harvest_id, grade_id and weight_g. One Growing crab per allocation; a crab is replaced at most once (ux_crab_item_replacement). «planned» survival rate counts every Dead crab of the funded boxes, restocked crabs included; a crab Lost in transit does not count (Figure 4.14).
  %% Today in code each harvested crab gets a printed tag (crab_tag) and packing scans an Active tag; removed in v1.4 (per-box harvest record and order QR code, UC33). Lost and DeliveredInKind are allowed by the CHECK but never written on develop; DeliveredInKind has no v1.4 use.
  classDef planned stroke-dasharray:5 5,stroke:#64748b,color:#64748b,fill:#f8fafc
  classDef notwritten stroke-dasharray:5 5,stroke:#9a3412,fill:#f1f5f9
  classDef terminal fill:#f1f5f9,stroke:#64748b
  class DeliveredInKind, Lost notwritten
  class Sold, Dead terminal
